                "text": "According to experts, cutting Medicaid could increase death rates, cause later stage diagnosis, and would be a 'huge hit' to hospitals, who will either have to close or cut back on care. In #OH13, where our hospital system is our biggest employer, any cuts to Medicaid would not only be devastating for public health -- it would decimate our local economy.\n\nhttps://t.co/cB22L2ejbA",
