                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Let's not forget that the Emergency Medical Treatment and Labor Act, or EMTALA, is the law that ensures hospitals treat everyone, regardless of their ability to pay. The Trump administration is trying to undermine this critical law \u2013 they just decided to drop a court case to fully enforce EMTALA, leaving not only pregnant women, but also working class Americans at risk of losing health care access.",
