                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In Ohio alone, the Republicans' reconciliation bill will kick 489,815 people off their health care; will put nearly 100,000 people at risk of going hungry; is likely to close 11 rural hospitals and 1 in 4 nursing homes; will eliminate 37,000 manufacturing jobs; and will raise energy costs for families by $410. \n\nOhio native JD Vance cast the tiebreak in vote in the Senate for it all.",
